OL,3,GNEWSAMan who drove at 100mph and hit
OL,4,Ateen jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drove at more than 100mph
OL,7,F(160km/h) in a 30mph (48 km/h) zone and
OL,8,Fleft a teenager with life-changing
OL,9,Finjuries has been jailed.
OL,11,FMohammed Khan hit the 17-year-old boy
OL,12,Fwith his Mercedes A45 on Halifax Road
OL,13,Fin Bradford on 16 September 2024.
OL,15,FAfter hitting the victim, who lost a
OL,16,Fleg as a result of the crash, Khan fled
OL,17,Fthe scene, removed his number plates
OL,18,Fand arranged for the car to be
OL,19,Frecovered and hidden, according to West
OL,20,FYorkshire Police.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
