OL,3,GNEWSAMan who drove at 100mph and hit
OL,4,Ateen jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 25-year-old, of Donisthorpe Street
OL,7,Fin Bradford, admitted causing serious
OL,8,Finjury by dangerous driving and
OL,9,Fperverting the course of justice and
OL,10,Fwas jailed for 40 months at Bradford
OL,11,FCrown Court on Friday.
